      "message": "fix(geometry): tolerance weld only as the slicer's fallback\n\nWelding every slice within 2 um changed the islands of an exact mesh\n(blind_floor's helix waterline shell ladder raised a Crossing). The\nexact 1 um key stays the first try; the tolerance weld runs only when\nthe exact one leaves chord ends dangling, so every mesh that sliced\nbefore slices exactly as before and only refused ones are rescued.\n\nRefs #241\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
